00:00:59.210 --> 00:01:01.277
there's a version
three, four, so on.

00:01:01.277 --> 00:01:03.110
In fact, some of our
clients deploy software

00:01:03.110 --> 00:01:05.670
even multiple times a day.

00:01:05.670 --> 00:01:07.910
But these kinds of
robust deployments

00:01:07.910 --> 00:01:10.820
of software to infrastructure
